# Startup & Shutdown Graceful Lifecycle

This plan outlines the implementation of a robust process management system to prevent multiple instances of the ImpressionCore backend and frontend from running simultaneously, which causes hardware locks and resource contention.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The startup script will now attempt to terminate existing `python.exe` and `node.exe` processes that carry the "ImpressionCore" window title. This ensures a clean slate but will close any hung sessions.

## Proposed Changes

---

### [Component] Global Process Management

#### [MODIFY] [orbos_ready.bat](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/orbos_ready.bat)
- Add `taskkill` commands to clear existing backend/frontend windows before starting new ones.
- Use window title filtering to avoid killing unrelated processes.

#### [MODIFY] [triad_api.py](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/triad_api.py)
- Implement `@app.post("/v1/system/shutdown")` endpoint.
- Trigger `triad_instance.shutdown()` which ensures `vision.close()` and `sensory.release()`.

#### [MODIFY] [App.jsx](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/web_client/src/App.jsx)
- Add a "SHUTDOWN SYSTEM" button to the sidebar or status panel.
- Implement an overlay that confirms shutdown and stops the browser-level polling.

### [Component] API & Monitoring

#### [MODIFY] [triad_api.py](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/triad_api.py)
- **Media SSoT**: Consolidated walkthroughs into a continuous chronological document with persistent media links.
- **Console Logging**: Implemented full console redirection for [triad_api.py](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/triad_api.py) to [logs/triad_api_console.log](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/logs/triad_api_console.log) with unbuffered flushing for real-time monitoring.
- **Sequential Startup**: Initiated implementation of intelligent polling in [orbos_ready.bat](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/orbos_ready.bat) to synchronize Backend, Frontend, and Browser launch.

### [Component] Orchestration

#### [MODIFY] [orbos_ready.bat](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/orbos_ready.bat)
- Replace static `timeout` with PowerShell-based polling loops.
- Polling Loop 1: Wait for `http://localhost:8000/v1/system/status` to contain `"loading_phase": "READY"`.
- Polling Loop 2: Wait for `http://localhost:3000` to be responsive before launching the browser.
- **OPTIMIZATION**: Move the Frontend launch (`npm run dev`) before the Backend polling to allow parallel initialization.
- **BUGFIX**: Quote or replace `&` in echo commands to prevent batch parsing errors.
- **FEEDBACK**: Display the current `loading_phase` in the terminal during polling.

### [Component] System Monitor Dashboard

#### [NEW] [system_monitor.html](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/web_client/public/system_monitor.html)
- Standalone HTML/JS page with 3 panels:
  1. **Orchestrator**: System Health & Uptime.
  2. **Triad API**: Loading Phase & Live Logs.
  3. **Vite Manager**: Frontend availability & port status.
- Implement 30s auto-refresh and manual refresh.

#### [MODIFY] [triad_api.py](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/triad_api.py)
- Implement `/v1/system/logs` endpoint to return the last 100 lines of `triad_api_console.log`.

- Launch [system_monitor.html](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/web_client/public/system_monitor.html) immediately (via [start](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/web_client/src/App.jsx#1030-1031)) before spawning Backend/Frontend.

### [Component] Spatial Fusion Logic (SpatialSense v1)

#### [MODIFY] [unified_triad.py](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/orchestrator/unified_triad.py)
- Refactor [get_fused_telemetry](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/orchestrator/unified_triad.py#654-693):
  - Calculate "Angular Distance" between Vision face center and Audio DoA.
  - Implement a confidence weighted "Fused Target X" [-1..1].
  - Provide a "Neural Focus" coordinate used for attention/VRAM-efficiency.

#### [MODIFY] [orbcloud_vision.py](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/orchestrator/orbcloud_vision.py)
- Integrate `audio_angle` into the [move_ptz](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/orchestrator/orbcloud_vision.py#1024-1075) / `digital_crop` logic.
- Implement "Audio-Assisted Face Discovery": High-speed scan in the quadrant of the audio angle when lock is lost.

#### [MODIFY] [App.jsx](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/src/interfaces/web_client/src/App.jsx)
- Update Acoustic Compass to show a "Target Lock" indicator when Vision and Audio angles align within 10 degrees.

