## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run [orbos_ready.bat](file:///d:/Projects/impressioncore/orbos_ready.bat) twice and verify that the first instance is terminated.
- Call `/v1/system/shutdown` via `curl` and verify `python.exe` exits.

### Manual Verification
- Click "SHUTDOWN" in the UI and observe hardware (camera LEDs) turning off.
